\": \"\"}","attachment_ids":null,"semantic_similarity":0.7984967471961084,"bm25_score":null,"rrf_score":0.013333333333333334,"rrf_rank":16,"semantic_rank":15,"cross_encoder_score":0.00001254477410839172,"cross_encoder_score_normalized":0.00001254477410839172,"rrf_normalized":0.0,"temporal":0.5,"recency":0.9753424660705226,"proof_norm":0.5,"combined_score":0.000013737386880587834,"weight":0.000013737386880587834,"activation":0.000013737386880587834}]},"entities":null,"chunks":{"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r03_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r03_0","text":"Agent-Reach Web read first calls normalize_public_http_url and requests https://r.jina.ai/ followed by that normalized URL. urlopen receives timeout=30. It calls resp.read(5*1024*1024+1), requesting up to that many bytes, and raises ValueError when the returned body exceeds 5*1024*1024 bytes (5 MiB). The shown timeout argument is not proof of an end-to-end deadline.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r05_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r05_0","text":"Agent-Reach YouTube readiness invokes probe_command for yt-dlp with [--version], timeout=10 and package=yt-dlp. A missing probe status yields off; broken or another non-ok probe yields error. It does not download a video in this check.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r04_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r04_0","text":"Agent-Reach Web check selects Jina Reader and returns the literal status ok without a network request. This readiness result does not prove that Jina Reader or any target page was retrieved.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r06_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r06_0","text":"After a successful yt-dlp probe, Agent-Reach YouTube readiness checks for Deno or Node. In the Node-present, Deno-absent branch, _has_js_runtime_config calls read_small_text_no_follow with max_bytes=1024*1024 and checks the returned text for the literal substring --js-runtimes. It does not parse or validate the flag's effective value; the reading helper was not inspected. Missing that substring leads to a warn branch.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r07_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r07_0","text":"Agent-Reach YouTube transcribe defaults provider to auto and allow_provider_fallback to False and passes both to the lazily imported agent_reach.transcribe.transcribe helper. That helper's implementation was not inspected, so its actual transcription and fallback behavior remain unknown.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r01_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r01_0","text":"Agent-Reach RSS readiness imports feedparser. ImportError yields off; another import-time exception yields error; a successful import yields ok and selects feedparser. This check does not fetch a feed.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null},"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r02_0":{"id":"zelo-5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-public_5c5eae20c40a4a26a9915e7ca63ecf50-r02_0","text":"Agent-Reach RSS can_handle lowercases the URL and tests whether any of the substrings /feed, /rss, .xml or atom occurs in it. This is URL substring matching, not parsing or fetching RSS/Atom content.","chunk_index":0,"truncated":false,"attachments":null}},"source_facts":null,"source_facts_truncated":null}